/* ============================================================
   ADS MODULE - STEP 1 SQL SCHEMA
   Football Prediction Game
   Purpose:
   1. Add Ads global settings into AutomationSettings
   2. Create Ads campaign table
   3. Create Ads slide table
   4. Create Ads analytics/log table
   ============================================================ */


